# Project-owned Leviathan particles. 20 Hz bursts, bounded by the engine pool.

effect leviathan_bolt_trail
  layer sparks count 3 life .2 .4 speed 0 1 spread 180 size .14 .02 color 1.4 0.2 2.8 1 to 1.4 0.2 2.8 0 drag 2 shape glow jitter .2
end

